                                "sense_id": "f5a56c4c-e33a-3ed4-9ce4-cbfc4043d0c5",
                                "text": "The diascope passes light through the two-dimensional object (such as a photographic transparency, slide, or film) and uses a converging projection lens to form an enlarged image on a distant screen."
